AuroraUI Library + Reaver Compatibility
Rayfield-like Roblox UI Library
All branding and logo replaced with 🗿 (Moai).
Compatible with Reaver API (CreateLib, NewTab, NewSection, NewButton, ...)
]]

local AuroraUI = {}
AuroraUI.__index = AuroraUI

